/// If this property is null, the [ExpansionTileThemeData.clipBehavior] is used. If that
/// is also null, defaults to [Clip.antiAlias].
///
/// See also:
///
/// * [ExpansionTileTheme.of], which returns the nearest [ExpansionTileTheme]'s
